## Anti Patterns

### 1. Alerting Everything

```yaml
# Không nên - too many alerts
alert: EverythingIsAnAlert
  expr: up == 1  # Fires constantly!
```

### 2. No Thresholds

```yaml
# Không nên - no context
alert: HighCPU
  expr: node_cpu_usage > 0
```

### 3. No Severity

```yaml
# Không nên - all alerts same severity
alert: SomeAlert
  expr: some_metric > threshold
# No labels for severity!
```

